portunistic with upgrades and keeping everyone happy. Falling behind may hinder progress and ultimately lead to your downfall!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perks change up gameplay and unlock new strategies: Unlock perks during runs and assign them before starting a new run. Perks may give bonuses but may have downsides. But the downsides might turn into upsides depending on other Perks! Have fun!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481360/extras/313143a9549656af19038693ddba8ba4.poster.avif?t=1753948339\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481360/extras/313143a9549656af19038693ddba8ba4.webm?t=1753948339\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3481360/extras/313143a9549656af19038693ddba8ba4.mp4?t=1753948339\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Content</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ perks to change up gameplay between runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ Card Effects to mix and match.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25+ Tier Up Bonus options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play board with 7 different ways to play or manipulate cards (Play Spaces, the Vault, the Combiner, the Randomiser, the Duplicator, and Ascenders Persist and Split). </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 phases to complete a run (make an Ally, turn an Enemy into an Ally, defeat the last Enemy)</p></li></ul>",
